# Fraud Intelligence Network (FIN)

FIN is the central intelligence layer of Persona AI.

FIN is NOT a visualization.

FIN continuously correlates:

• Fraud reports
• Device fingerprints
• Browser fingerprints
• Sessions
• Trusted devices
• Trusted locations
• Beneficiaries
• Behavioral similarity
• Government intelligence (FRI/MNRL)

Customer Features

• Login timeline
• Trusted devices
• Trusted locations
• Report fraud
• Report suspicious transaction
• Report suspicious user

Admin Features

• Interactive relationship graph
• Fraud clusters
• Investigation timeline
• Threat heatmap
• Case management
• Device intelligence

FIN should actively contribute to future AI risk assessments.

Every verified fraud report should strengthen future protection.
